#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This Procedure has the vehicle driving over a small, smooth bump at 40 kph.
#
#The small bump was created using a new screen in CarSim 8.2 which allows you to enter data for the incremental elevation and dz ratio seperately.
#
#To see how this is done, click on the blue link for the 3D road "Small, Smooth Bump."
#
#This will bring you to the Road: 3D Surface screen. On this screen, click on the Off-center elevation dataset "Small, Smooth Bump."
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

